---
description: Every authenticated user must always belong to an organization (tenant).
alwaysApply: true
---

# Organization membership invariant

- **No user may be left without a tenant**: registration and organization APIs must call `ensureOrganizationForUser` (or equivalent) so every user has exactly one `tenant_members` record.
- **Removing a member** from a tenant must immediately provision a new default organization for that user (see `removeMemberFromTenant` in `packages/server/src/services/organizationService.ts`).
- **Do not** add code paths that clear membership without creating or transferring to another tenant.
- When changing auth or profile flows, keep organization provisioning in sync (e.g. after `upsertProfile` on register).
